BT /F1 11 Tf 0.060 0.160 0.200 rg 56 574 Td (Dear Sir or Madam,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.060 0.160 0.200 rg 56 548 Td (The Ministry is rolling out a Letter Management System that lets government) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.060 0.160 0.200 rg 56 532 Td (organizations register, route and track official correspondence electronically. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.060 0.160 0.200 rg 56 516 Td (system replaces the paper registry with a searchable record and a full audit trail for) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.060 0.160 0.200 rg 56 500 Td (every letter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.060 0.160 0.200 rg 56 478 Td (Before the system is extended to all federal institutions, we are collecting comments) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.060 0.160 0.200 rg 56 462 Td (from the organizations that took part in the pilot. Your office handled a large share of) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.060 0.160 0.200 rg 56 446 Td (the pilot correspondence and your experience is valuable to us.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.060 0.160 0.200 rg 56 424 Td (We kindly request your written comments on the points listed in the annex on the next) Tj ET
