BT /F1 11 Tf 0.060 0.160 0.200 rg 56 392 Td (training your records officers will need.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.060 0.160 0.200 rg 56 370 Td (Please send your comments within ten working days of receiving this letter so that they) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.060 0.160 0.200 rg 56 354 Td (can be considered before the next release.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.060 0.160 0.200 rg 56 322 Td (With regards,) Tj ET
